Chessboard was added in '''Beta 46.0''', alongside and working with the [[:Category:Piece|Piece]] Tribe (which was originally named Chess Figure). '''Beta 46.1''' added this to the Tribe (and renamed it). '''Beta 54.0''' reduced its HP from 5 to 4.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 4

HP:

* 5 (Post Beta 46.0)
* 4 (Post Beta 54.0, Current)

Cost: 5

Abilities:
* Magic: Copy all positive effects from all ally Pieces. (Beta 46.0)
* '''[Now counts as a Piece.]''' (Post Beta 46.1, Current)
Rarity: Blue (Rare)

== Trivia ==

* While it didn't change itself between Beta 46.1 and Beta 54.0, it did got 2 wording updates due to the removal of Ranged in Beta 47.0 and Thorns in Beta 49.0.

